    "title": "Kristi Noem exits DHS with a victory lap and a new title as Mullin takes the helm - Whatfinger News Quick Hits",
    "text": "Kristi Noem posted a farewell statement on X Tuesday as she handed over the reins at the Department of Homeland Security to former Oklahoma Senator Markwayne Mullin, who was sworn in the same day.\nAccording to People, Noem used the post to highlight what she characterized as a historic run of accomplishments at the agency, thanking President Trump “for entrusting me to lead the department leading the fight to Make America Safe Again.”\nRead Full Article: https://conservativeinstitute.org/politics/kristi-noem-exits-dhs-with-a-victory-lap-and-a-new-title-as-mullin-takes-the-helm.htm",
